LOCATION:Catalina Jazz Club\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Los Angeles Jazz Society Jazz Treasure Award recipient
 
 Betty Bryant returns to celebrate another trip around the sun. \, "rdquo" 
 
-> With Shirley Horn and Hadda Brooks gone\, singer-pianist Betty Bryant ma
 
y be our last practitioner of a brand of cool\, sly\, laid-back swing honed
 
 in a thousand smoky saloons on a million nights. Betty has worked in the f
 
ast lane of West Coast jazz for over sixty years\, but she knows how to tak
 
e her time." --- James Gavin - Author\, Journalist Catalina Jazz Club 6725 
 
West Sunset Blvd. Hollywood\, CA 90028 *Tickets purchased online receive pr
 
iority seating. *Single Entree or Drink minimums apply for all tickets Tick
 
ets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/betty-bryant-birthday-bash-brun
 
